# SetDraftStatus: SemQL enricher on GovernanceRule of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Stepper only: a new rule starts as DRAFT.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.enrichers
_type: SemQLEnricher
_name: SetDraftStatus
entity: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.GovernanceRule
label: Set draft status
description: 'Stepper only: a new rule starts as DRAFT.'
enricherExecutionScope: NONE
condition: LifecycleStatus IS NULL
semQlEnricherExpressions:
- attributeName: LifecycleStatus
  expression: '''DRAFT'''
